s and inactivates EGFRs, Src family kinases, Janus-activated kinases (JAKs)-1 and -3, and signal transducer and activators of transcription (STATs)-1, -3 and -5, in a cell","Publisher":{"Name":"InterPro"}}}]}}]}]}}